<title>USA: NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-CAREER COACHING RECORD OF BILL PARCELLS.</title>
<headline>NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-CAREER COACHING RECORD OF BILL PARCELLS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Football League career</p>
<p>coaching record of Bill Parcells, named Tuesday as consultant</p>
<p>for the New York Jets in 1997 and head coach/general manager</p>
<p>for the 1998 season (tabulate under year, team, wins, losses,</p>
<p>ties, winning percentage):</p>
<p>Regular season</p>
<p>1983 New York Giants	   3  12   1  .219</p>
<p>1984 New York Giants	   9   7   0  .563</p>
<p>1985 New York Giants	  10   6   0  .625</p>
<p>1986 New York Giants	  14   2   0  .875</p>
<p>1987 New York Giants	   6   9   0  .400</p>
<p>1988 New York Giants	  10   6   0  .625</p>
<p>1989 New York Giants	  12   4   0  .750</p>
<p>1990 New York Giants	  13   3   0  .813</p>
<p>1993 New England Patriots    5  11   0  .313</p>
<p>1994 New England Patriots   10   6   0  .625</p>
<p>1995 New England Patriots    6  10   0  .375</p>
<p>1996 New England Patriots   11   5   0  .688</p>
<p>    Totals		     109  81   1  .573</p>
<p>Post-season</p>
<p>1984 New York Giants	   1   1   0  .500</p>
<p>1985 New York Giants	   1   1   0  .500</p>
<p>1986 New York Giants	   3   0   0 1.000 (won Super Bowl)</p>
<p>1989 New York Giants	   0   1   0  .000</p>
<p>1990 New York Giants	   3   0   0 1.000 (won Super Bowl)</p>
<p>1994 New England Patriots    0   1   0  .000</p>
<p>1996 New England Patriots    2   1   0  .667 (Super Bowl</p>
<p>runner-up)</p>
<p>    Totals		     10   5   0  .667</p>
